      "message": "Hi Jaewan,\n\nIn discussion https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Virtualization/+/2950433/comment/b7796ea5_f8ea5084/, I promised to move `VM_REFERENCE_DT_ON_HOST_PATH` out of this module. Let me do that in a follow up patch to keep REVERT^2 exact same of original patch?",
