      "message": "\u003e it doesnt really throw error in case of all kind of existing node/props\n\nThis is not true. No FDT API allows overwriting of existing node while OK for props. Exception is `fdt_overlay_apply()` but its name \u0027overlay\u0027 may imply so.\n\nAnyway, I\u0027m OK if you prefer `overlay_onto`.\n\nBut still, could you drop `DtAddition`?",
